{
  "schema": "combat.templates/1",
  "_about": "Exchange templates as data (Combat). Two timing profiles per branch. 'parity' reproduces sim/director/melee.gd, beam.gd and exchange.gd chain() at commit 69c4a2f exactly: same beats, same scheduling order, same RNG draws in the same order. 'spaced' keeps every outcome, damage, force, tag and draw of parity but re-times the beats to balance-targets.md section 10 (0.25 to 0.40 s between contacts, 6 to 10 beats) and adds render-only 'cue' beats. Contract, value forms and verification: docs/combat/data-fields.md section 10 and docs/combat/s3b-loader-note.md.",
  "profile": "parity",

  "profiles": {
    "parity": {
      "timeUnit": "s",
      "approach": { "divisor": 2600, "min": 0.18, "max": 0.65, "_note": "rt = clamp(dist / divisor, min, max), melee.gd line 19" },
      "aiParryPressDelay": [0.05, 0.16]
    },
    "spaced": {
      "timeUnit": "tick",
      "ticksPerSecond": 60,
      "tempo": { "step": 21, "windup": 15, "heavyWindup": 20, "follow": 3, "tell": 18,
                 "_note": "ticks. step 0.35 s between contacts; windup 0.25 s before a parryable strike (proposal for Controls, section 10 asks 0.20 to 0.30); heavyWindup 0.333 s (Controls' 20-tick proposal); follow 0.05 s from a strike to its launch; tell 0.30 s. QA tunes 'step' first: each +3 ticks moves the median exchange by about +0.2 s" },
      "approach": { "divisor": 2600, "min": 0.40, "max": 0.65,
                    "pursuit": { "beyond": 2500, "base": 0.8, "per": 3000, "max": 2.0 },
                    "rounding": "round half up to whole ticks",
                    "_note": "c (the contact anchor) = clamp(dist / divisor, min, max) seconds for dist up to 'beyond'; past it a visible pursuit flight of clamp(base + (dist - beyond) / per, base, max) s (section 10: 0.8 to 2.0 s). Encounter applies SimConst.WS as it does today" },
      "aiParryPressDelay": [0.05, 0.54],
      "_aiNote": "The AI defender's press delay after the wind beat. With the wider 0.25 s window, [0.05, 0.54] keeps the AI's parry success per attempt near today's 41%. Encounter owns the AI policy and may retune.",
      "parry": {
        "windowTicks": { "light": 15, "heavy": 20 }, "bufferTicks": 4, "cleanTicks": { "light": 6, "heavy": 8 },
        "reward": { "damage": 18, "ki": 8, "stopTicks": 9, "pushback": 520, "cue": "parry" },
        "cleanReward": { "damage": 18, "ki": 12, "stopTicks": 12, "pushback": 520, "cue": "clean_parry" },
        "_note": "Widths, buffer and hit-stop ticks are Controls' (docs/controls/rulings.md sections 3 and 5). Combat accepts the clean-parry reward: +4 ki (12 in all), a 12-tick freeze and a distinct cue, with no extra damage, so the parry stays a tempo and resource reward rather than a damage source. Parity keeps the code's values (18 damage, 8 ki, stop 0.12 s, pushback 520)."
      },
      "hitstopFloors": { "light": 0.07, "heavy": 0.12, "finisher": 0.30, "adopted": false,
                         "_note": "section 10 floors, a proposal for Controls (hit-stop table owner). The loader applies max(stop, floor) only once Controls adopts them" }
    }
  },

  "locals": {
    "rt": "approach(dist) in the active profile: 'rt' in parity (seconds), 'c' in spaced (ticks)",
    "base": { "light": 26, "heavy": 66 },
    "dist": "abs(sdx(A.x, D.x)) at plan time"
  },

  "templates": [
    {
      "id": "charge_interrupt",
      "trigger": { "kinds": ["light", "heavy"], "defender": "CHARGING" },
      "selector": { "kind": "fixed", "branch": "interrupt" },
      "branches": [
        {
          "id": "interrupt", "tag": "CHARGE INTERRUPT", "favours": "attacker", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "parity": [
            { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "rt" } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 1.4 }, "o": { "noParry": true, "ignoreStance": true, "big": true } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.05 }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": { "light": 900, "heavy": 1500 }, "rev": false } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.32 }, "op": "window" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "c" } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "sub": ["tell"] }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "tell", "who": "D" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 1.4 }, "o": { "noParry": true, "ignoreStance": true, "big": true } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": { "light": 900, "heavy": 1500 }, "rev": false } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "pursue", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 2, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "window" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "pursuit",
      "trigger": { "kinds": ["light", "heavy"], "defender": "ESCAPE" },
      "selector": {
        "kind": "threshold", "draw": "next", "ifBelow": "slips", "else": "caught",
        "p": { "start": 0.5,
               "terms": [ { "coef": 0.07, "diff": ["D.tier", "A.tier"] },
                          { "if": { "var": "dist", "op": ">", "value": 800 }, "then": 0.12, "else": 0.0 },
                          { "if": { "var": "A.ambush" }, "then": -1.0, "else": 0.0 } ],
               "clamp": [0.05, 0.88] },
        "_formula": "pEsc = clamp(0.5 + 0.07*(D.tier - A.tier) + (dist > 800 ? 0.12 : 0) - (A.ambush ? 1 : 0), 0.05, 0.88); one S.rng.next(), drawn before any beat is scheduled (melee.gd lines 33-34)"
      },
      "branches": [
        {
          "id": "slips", "tag": "PURSUIT — TARGET SLIPS AWAY", "tagProposed": "PURSUIT — SLIPPED AWAY", "favours": "neutral", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "_spacedNote": "An escape is short by design (5 beats): holding the attacker longer would be dead air.",
          "parity": [
            { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 260, "dur": { "ref": "rt", "times": 0.8 } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "times": 0.55 }, "op": "slip" },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.5 }, "op": "nop" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 260, "dur": { "ref": "c", "times": 0.8 } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "times": 0.55 }, "op": "slip" },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "times": 0.55, "step": 1 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "pull_up", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "times": 0.55, "step": 2 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "scan", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "times": 0.55, "step": 3 }, "op": "nop" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "caught", "tag": "PURSUIT — CAUGHT", "favours": "attacker", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "parity": [
            { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "rt" } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 1.2 }, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.05 }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": { "light": 800, "heavy": 1500 }, "rev": false } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.3 }, "op": "window" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "c" } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "sub": ["tell"] }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "glance_back", "who": "D" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c" }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "catch", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 1.2 }, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": { "light": 800, "heavy": 1500 }, "rev": false } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 2, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "window" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "dodge",
      "trigger": { "kinds": ["light", "heavy"], "defender": "EVASIVE" },
      "selector": {
        "kind": "threshold", "draw": "next", "ifBelow": "read", "else": "counter",
        "override": { "if": { "var": "A.ambush" }, "p": 1.0 },
        "p": { "start": 0.42,
               "terms": [ { "coef": 0.08, "diff": ["A.tier", "D.tier"] },
                          { "if": { "var": "A.stance", "op": "==", "value": 0 }, "then": 0.08, "else": 0.0 },
                          { "if": { "var": "A.ki", "op": "<", "value": 12 }, "then": -0.12, "else": 0.0 },
                          { "if": { "var": "heavy" }, "then": -0.05, "else": 0.0 } ],
               "clamp": [0.15, 0.8] },
        "_formula": "pRead = A.ambush ? 1.0 : clamp(0.42 + 0.08*(A.tier - D.tier) + (A.stance == 0 ? 0.08 : 0) - (A.ki < 12 ? 0.12 : 0) - (heavy ? 0.05 : 0), 0.15, 0.8); one S.rng.next(), always drawn, even under an ambush (melee.gd lines 51-52)"
      },
      "branches": [
        {
          "id": "read", "tag": "DODGE & READ", "tagProposed": "DODGE — SEEN THROUGH", "favours": "attacker", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "_spacedNote": "The parity wind beat (a parry window that can never parry, CC-009) is dropped in spaced; that removes the AI defender's press draws here.",
          "parity": [
            { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "rt" } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": -0.12 }, "op": "wind" },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt" }, "op": "dodge" },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.22 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base" }, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.27 }, "op": "launch", "when": "heavy", "args": { "force": 1400, "rev": false } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.5 }, "op": "window" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "c" } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "sub": ["tell"] }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "tell", "who": "D" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c" }, "op": "dodge" },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "whiff_recover", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 2 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "turn_read", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base" }, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "launch", "when": "heavy", "args": { "force": 1400, "rev": false } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 4, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "window" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "counter", "tag": "DODGE & COUNTER", "tagProposed": "DODGE — COUNTER", "favours": "defender", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "parity": [
            { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "rt" } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": -0.12 }, "op": "wind" },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt" }, "op": "dodge" },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.24 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 0.9 }, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.3 }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": 900, "rev": true } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.6 }, "op": "nop" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "c" } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "sub": ["tell"] }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "tell", "who": "D" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c" }, "op": "dodge" },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "exposed", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 2 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "overextend", "who": "A" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 0.9 }, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": 900, "rev": true } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 4, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "recover", "who": "D" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 5, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "nop" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "pressure",
      "trigger": { "kinds": ["light"], "defender": "DEFENSIVE" },
      "selector": {
        "kind": "gated_threshold", "gate": { "var": "D.ki", "op": ">", "value": 25 }, "draw": "next", "p": 0.4,
        "ifBelow": "counter", "else": "holds",
        "_formula": "counter if D.ki > 25 and S.rng.next() < 0.4. The draw happens only when the gate passes (short-circuit), after the three strikes are scheduled (melee.gd line 74)"
      },
      "shared": {
        "parity": [
          { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "rt" } } },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": -0.1 }, "op": "wind" },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 26, "o": { "kb": 120 } } },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.16 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 26, "o": { "kb": 120, "noParry": true } } },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.32 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 26, "o": { "kb": 120, "noParry": true } } }
        ],
        "spaced": [
          { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "c" } } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "sub": ["windup"] }, "op": "wind" },
          { "tick": { "at": "c" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 26, "o": { "kb": 120 } } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 26, "o": { "kb": 120, "noParry": true } } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 2 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 26, "o": { "kb": 120, "noParry": true } } }
        ]
      },
      "branches": [
        {
          "id": "holds", "tag": "PRESSURE — GUARD HOLDS", "favours": "attacker", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "_ruleNote": "Game Design's R6 (no chain window after GUARD HOLDS) is a rule change for a later slice; both profiles keep today's window.",
          "parity": [
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.42 }, "op": "window" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "guard_set", "who": "D" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 4 }, "op": "window" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "counter", "tag": "PRESSURE — GUARD HOLDS → COUNTER", "favours": "neutral", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "parity": [
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.55 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": 24, "o": { "noParry": true, "ignoreStance": true } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.8 }, "op": "nop" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": 24, "o": { "noParry": true, "ignoreStance": true } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 4 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "reset", "who": "both" } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 5 }, "op": "nop" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "guard_break",
      "trigger": { "kinds": ["heavy"], "defender": "DEFENSIVE" },
      "selector": { "kind": "fixed", "branch": "break" },
      "branches": [
        {
          "id": "break", "tag": "GUARD BREAK", "favours": "attacker", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "parity": [
            { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "rt" } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": -0.1 }, "op": "wind" },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 45, "o": { "kb": 150 } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.2 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 45, "o": { "kb": 150, "noParry": true } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.4 }, "op": "guardBreak" },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.42 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 1.15 }, "o": { "noParry": true, "ignoreStance": true, "stop": 0.12, "shake": 12, "big": true, "kind": "guard_break" } } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.46 }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": 1700, "rev": false } },
            { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.72 }, "op": "window" }
          ],
          "spaced": [
            { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "c" } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "sub": ["windup"] }, "op": "wind" },
            { "tick": { "at": "c" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 45, "o": { "kb": 150 } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 45, "o": { "kb": 150, "noParry": true } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 2 }, "op": "guardBreak" },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": { "ref": "base", "times": 1.15 }, "o": { "noParry": true, "ignoreStance": true, "stop": 0.12, "shake": 12, "big": true, "kind": "guard_break" } } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "launch", "args": { "force": 1700, "rev": false } },
            { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 4, "add": ["follow"] }, "op": "window" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "trade_blows",
      "trigger": { "kinds": ["light"], "defender": "AGGRESSIVE" },
      "selector": {
        "kind": "score_compare", "order": ["A", "D"], "ifGreater": "won", "else": "lost",
        "score": { "sum": [ { "var": "f.tier" }, { "div": ["f.ki", 70] }, { "draw": [0.0, 1.6] },
                            { "if": { "gt": ["vitality(f)", "vitality(o)"] }, "then": 0.3, "else": 0.0 } ] },
        "_formula": "won if score(A, D) > score(D, A), score(f, o) = f.tier + f.ki / 70 + S.rng.range_(0, 1.6) + (vitality(f) > vitality(o) ? 0.3 : 0), summed left to right; A's score (and its draw) first (melee.gd lines 94 and 129-130)"
      },
      "shared": {
        "parity": [
          { "t": 0, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "rt" } } },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": -0.1 }, "op": "wind" },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 24 } },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.17 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": 20, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.34 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 24, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
          { "t": { "ref": "rt", "plus": 0.51 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": 20, "o": { "noParry": true } } }
        ],
        "spaced": [
          { "tick": { "at": "start" }, "op": "rush", "args": { "off": 58, "dur": { "ref": "c" } } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "sub": ["windup"] }, "op": "wind" },
          { "tick": { "at": "c" }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 24 } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 1 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": 20, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 2 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "A", "d": "D", "dmg": 24, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 3 }, "op": "strike", "args": { "a": "D", "d": "A", "dmg": 20, "o": { "noParry": true } } },
          { "tick": { "at": "c", "step": 4 }, "op": "cue", "args": { "cue": "bind", "who": "both" } }
        ]
      },
      "branches": [
        {
          "id": "won", "tag": "TRADE BLOWS", "tagProposed": "TRADE BLOWS — WON", "favours": "attacker", "spacedTiming": "changes",
          "parity": [
